      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Happy Camp lies on the Klamath River, where several creeks—Elk, Little Grider, Indian, Doolittle, Ikes, Deer Lick, and Cade—converge.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
