      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The nearby Marble Mountains host nearly a hundred lakes, including Spirit Lake, which has a luminescent chemical that can glow in the dark.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25,
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Happy_Camp%2C_California",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Happy Camp’s history traces back to the Gold Rush, followed by a timber boom that later declined, shaping its rugged character.",
